    "serious_injury_recall": false,
    "quote": "When any model exceeds 8 thermal incidents per 100,000 installed units in a year, the manufacturer must promptly notify the regulator and affected customers, submit the model’s incident data and a risk-mitigation plan, and initiate a recall."
